{"seq":3,"slug":"observability-as-code","title":"可观测性即代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/observability-engineering/observability-platforms/observability-as-code","wordCount":1146,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"可观测性即代码\">可观测性即代码</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可观测性即代码（Observability as Code, OaC）是将可观测性系统的所有配置——仪表盘、告警规则、SLO 定义、数据源配置和通知渠道——以声明式代码的形式管理，纳入版本控制系统，通过 CI/CD 流水线自动部署。OaC 将可观测性配置从&quot;在 Web UI 上手动点击&quot;转变为&quot;在代码仓库中审查和提交&quot;，解决了传统手动配置方式面临的三大问题：配置漂移（环境间不一致）、变更不可追溯和难以规模化管理。</p>\n<p>OaC 的理念源自 Infrastructure as Code（IaC），核心原则是：<strong>声明式定义</strong>（描述期望状态而非操作步骤）、<strong>版本控制</strong>（所有变更可追溯可回滚）、<strong>自动化部署</strong>（通过 CI/CD 消除人工操作）和<strong>环境一致性</strong>（开发/预发/生产使用相同的配置模板）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 传统手动配置&#10;        A[工程师] --&gt; B[Grafana UI]&#10;        B --&gt; C[仪表盘]&#10;        A --&gt; D[Alertmanager UI]&#10;        D --&gt; E[告警规则]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph OaC配置&#10;        F[代码仓库] --&gt; G[PR审查]&#10;        G --&gt; H[CI/CD]&#10;        H --&gt; I[Terraform/Grafana Provisioning]&#10;        I --&gt; J[仪表盘+告警+SLO]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 传统手动配置\n        A[工程师] --&gt; B[Grafana UI]\n        B --&gt; C[仪表盘]\n        A --&gt; D[Alertmanager UI]\n        D --&gt; E[告警规则]\n    end\n    subgraph OaC配置\n        F[代码仓库] --&gt; G[PR审查]\n        G --&gt; H[CI/CD]\n        H --&gt; I[Terraform/Grafana Provisioning]\n        I --&gt; J[仪表盘+告警+SLO]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置方式</th>\n<th>可追溯性</th>\n<th>环境一致性</th>\n<th>协作效率</th>\n<th>规模化</th>\n<th>风险控制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>手动 UI 配置</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>低（手动复制）</td>\n<td>低（单人操作）</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导出 JSON 备份</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>中（定期同步）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provisioning 文件</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Terraform 管理</td>\n<td>最佳</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"terraform-管理可观测性资源\">Terraform 管理可观测性资源</h2><p>Terraform 通过其 Provider 生态系统可以管理几乎所有可观测性平台的资源。Grafana Provider 支持管理仪表盘、数据源、告警规则、文件夹和团队权限。Datadog Provider 和 New Relic Provider 同样提供了完整的资源管理能力。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TerraformGrafanaResources {&#10;  datasource: {&#10;    type: string;&#10;    url: string;&#10;    jsonDataEncoded: string;&#10;  };&#10;  folder: {&#10;    title: string;&#10;    uid: string;&#10;  };&#10;  dashboard: {&#10;    configJson: string;&#10;    folder: string;&#10;    overwrite: boolean;&#10;  };&#10;  alertRule: {&#10;    name: string;&#10;    condition: string;&#10;    notifications: string[];&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TerraformGrafanaResources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  datasource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    jsonDataEncoded</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  folder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    title</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    uid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dashboard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    configJson</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    folder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    overwrite</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  alertRule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    condition</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    notifications</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"hcl\" data-code=\"resource &quot;grafana_data_source&quot; &quot;prometheus&quot; {&#10;  type = &quot;prometheus&quot;&#10;  name = &quot;Mimir-Production&quot;&#10;  url  = &quot;https://mimir.internal:9009/prometheus&quot;&#10;&#10;  json_data_encoded = jsonencode({&#10;    httpMethod   = &quot;POST&quot;&#10;    exemplarTraceIdDestinations = [{&#10;      datasourceUid = grafana_data_source.tempo.uid&#10;      name          = &quot;traceID&quot;&#10;    }]&#10;  })&#10;}&#10;&#10;resource &quot;grafana_folder&quot; &quot;platform&quot; {&#10;  title = &quot;Platform Team&quot;&#10;  uid   = &quot;platform-team&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;resource &quot;grafana_dashboard&quot; &quot;service_overview&quot; {&#10;  folder    = grafana_folder.platform.id&#10;  overwrite = true&#10;&#10;  config_json = templatefile(&quot;${path.module}/dashboards/service-overview.json&quot;, {&#10;    datasource_uid = grafana_data_source.prometheus.uid&#10;    environment    = var.environment&#10;  })&#10;}&#10;&#10;resource &quot;grafana_rule_group&quot; &quot;slo_alerts&quot; {&#10;  org_id           = 1&#10;  name             = &quot;SLO Alerts&quot;&#10;  folder_uid       = grafana_folder.platform.uid&#10;  interval_seconds = 60&#10;&#10;  rule {&#10;    name      = &quot;High Error Budget Burn Rate&quot;&#10;    condition = &quot;C&quot;&#10;&#10;    data {&#10;      ref_id = &quot;A&quot;&#10;      relative_time_range {&#10;        from = 3600&#10;        to   = 0&#10;      }&#10;      datasource_uid = grafana_data_source.prometheus.uid&#10;      model = jsonencode({&#10;        expr = &quot;sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\\&quot;5..\\&quot;}[1h])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[1h]))&quot;&#10;      })&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>resource \"grafana_data_source\" \"prometheus\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type = \"prometheus\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name = \"Mimir-Production\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  url  = \"https://mimir.internal:9009/prometheus\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  json_data_encoded = jsonencode({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    httpMethod   = \"POST\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    exemplarTraceIdDestinations = [{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      datasourceUid = grafana_data_source.tempo.uid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      name          = \"traceID\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>resource \"grafana_folder\" \"platform\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title = \"Platform Team\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  uid   = \"platform-team\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>resource \"grafana_dashboard\" \"service_overview\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  folder    = grafana_folder.platform.id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  overwrite = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  config_json = templatefile(\"${path.module}/dashboards/service-overview.json\", {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    datasource_uid = grafana_data_source.prometheus.uid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    environment    = var.environment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>resource \"grafana_rule_group\" \"slo_alerts\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  org_id           = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name             = \"SLO Alerts\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  folder_uid       = grafana_folder.platform.uid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  interval_seconds = 60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name      = \"High Error Budget Burn Rate\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    condition = \"C\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ref_id = \"A\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      relative_time_range {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        from = 3600</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        to   = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      datasource_uid = grafana_data_source.prometheus.uid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      model = jsonencode({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        expr = \"sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\\\"5..\\\"}[1h])) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[1h]))\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"grafana-provisioning\">Grafana Provisioning</h2><p>Grafana 内置的 Provisioning 机制允许通过 YAML 配置文件和 JSON 仪表盘文件来管理 Grafana 的数据源、仪表盘和告警通知渠道。这是一种比 Terraform 更轻量的 OaC 实现方式，特别适合 Kubernetes 环境中通过 ConfigMap 管理 Grafana 配置。</p>\n<p><strong>数据源 Provisioning</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: 1&#10;datasources:&#10;  - name: Mimir&#10;    type: prometheus&#10;    access: proxy&#10;    url: http://mimir-query-frontend:8080/prometheus&#10;    isDefault: true&#10;    jsonData:&#10;      httpMethod: POST&#10;      exemplarTraceIdDestinations:&#10;        - datasourceUid: tempo&#10;          name: traceID&#10;&#10;  - name: Loki&#10;    type: loki&#10;    access: proxy&#10;    url: http://loki-gateway:3100&#10;    jsonData:&#10;      derivedFields:&#10;        - datasourceUid: tempo&#10;          matcherRegex: &quot;traceID=(\\\\w+)&quot;&#10;          name: TraceID&#10;          url: &#39;$${__value.raw}&#39;&#10;&#10;  - name: Tempo&#10;    type: tempo&#10;    access: proxy&#10;    url: http://tempo-query-frontend:3100&#10;    uid: tempo&#10;    jsonData:&#10;      tracesToLogsV2:&#10;        datasourceUid: loki&#10;        filterByTraceID: true&#10;      tracesToMetrics:&#10;        datasourceUid: mimir\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">datasources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Mimir</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prometheus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    access</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">proxy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http://mimir-query-frontend:8080/prometheus</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#8